<title>USA: Hollywood Park says Nevada okays merger.</title>
<headline>Hollywood Park says Nevada okays merger.</headline>
<dateline>INGLEWOOD, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollywood Park Inc on Wednesday said the Nevada Gaming Commission has approved its merger with Boomtown Inc, an owner and operator of casinos in Nevada, Mississippi and Louisiana.</p>
<p>Inglewood-based Hollywood Park said it expects to complete the merger at the end of May following approval in Louisiana.</p>
<p>Shareholders of both companies approved the deal last year, and it also has been approved by Mississippi regulators.</p>
</text>
